AUDIO: 'You give MiniMax H3 a video, tell it what you want to change, and it can transform the entire scene while keeping the original motion, camera movement, timing, or pretty much anything else you want to preserve. Inside ComfyUI, um you'

[00:13] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'can use a reference video and turn it into something completely different, whether that\'s changing the character, replacing an outfit, creating an entirely new scene, copying a background'

[00:25] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'or environment, or even transferring the motion from one video to another. MiniMax H3 can take the motion and information from your reference video'

